DESCRIPTION:University Theatre presents Rock of Ages\, the hit musical feat
 uring live music and classic songs by Styx\, Journey\, Bon Jovi\, Whitesna
 ke\, Twisted Sister\, and more. It is the tail end of the 1980s on Hollywo
 od’s Sunset Strip\, where aspiring rock star Drew dreams of taking the s
 tage and falling in love with Sherrie\, a small-town girl newly arrived in
  Los Angeles. When developers threaten to replace the Strip’s legendary 
 rock venues with a shopping complex\, Drew\, Sherrie\, and an unforgettabl
 e group of musicians\, dreamers\, and devoted rock fans must come together
  to save their beloved neighborhood. Packed with iconic songs\, big person
 alities\, and plenty of 1980s energy\, Rock of Ages is a celebration of dr
 eams\, determination\, and the music that defined a generation. MU Student
 s can purchase up to one (1) discounted ticket for $5.00 with a valid MU I
